          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Search places, get directions and travel times, and find where this Mac is." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Orte suchen, Routen und Fahrzeiten abrufen und den Standort dieses Macs finden."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "搜索地点、获取路线和行程时间，并查找这台 Mac 的位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Search services" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dienste suchen"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "搜索服务"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Search, read, create and add to notes. macOS asks the first time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Notizen durchsuchen, lesen, erstellen und ergänzen. macOS fragt beim ersten Mal."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "搜索、阅读、创建和补充备忘录。macOS 会在首次使用时询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Seconds before a toast dismisses itself. Empty uses the default of 5 seconds." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sekunden, bis eine Benachrichtigung von selbst verschwindet. Leer bedeutet den Standardwert von 5 Sekunden."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通知自动消失前的秒数。留空则使用默认的 5 秒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "See what's playing, control playback and play from your library. macOS asks the first time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sehen, was läuft, die Wiedergabe steuern und aus deiner Mediathek abspielen. macOS fragt beim ersten Mal."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "查看正在播放的内容、控制播放并从你的资料库中播放。macOS 会在首次使用时询问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Self-scheduling is off. Turn it on under Overview → Autonomy & Data to let the agent schedule its own runs. Schedules and folder watchers you create yourself are under Automation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Selbstplanung ist aus. Schalte sie unter Übersicht → Autonomie & Daten ein, damit der Agent seine eigenen Läufe planen kann. Selbst erstellte Zeitpläne und Ordnerüberwachungen findest du unter Automatisierung."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自调度已关闭。在“概述 → 自主与数据”中开启后，智能体即可自行安排运行。你自己创建的计划和文件夹监视在“自动化”中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Self-scheduling off" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Selbstplanung aus"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自调度已关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send messages directly to the model with no tool specs or capability injection. Turn off to let agents use built-in and plugin tools." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sendet Nachrichten direkt an das Modell, ohne Tool-Beschreibungen oder Fähigkeiten. Schalte es aus, damit Agenten eingebaute und Plugin-Tools nutzen können."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "直接将消息发送给模型，不附带工具说明或能力注入。关闭后，智能体即可使用内置工具和插件工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sends text to any server implementing the OpenAI /v1/audio/speech API, such as openai-edge-tts or Kokoro." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
