    },
    "Ask for something real. It uses the web, your files, and your apps to finish the job, then double-checks before answering." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitte um etwas Konkretes. Es nutzt das Web, deine Dateien und deine Apps, um die Aufgabe zu erledigen, und prüft alles noch einmal, bevor es antwortet."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提出一个真实的任务。它会使用网络、你的文件和你的应用来完成工作，并在回答前再次核对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the agent in chat to remember or track something — it will set up its own tables, and this overview fills in as it works." : {
      "comment" : "A subtitle for the \"This agent hasn't stored anything yet.\" empty state in the DatabaseOverviewView.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ask the agent in chat to remember or track something — it will set up its own tables, and this overview fills in as it works."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ask the agent in chat to remember or track something — it will set up its own tables, and this overview fills in as it works."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Ask the agent in chat to remember or track something — it will set up its own tables, and this overview fills in as it works."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在聊天中让智能体记住或跟踪某些内容 — 它会建立自己的表，此概览会随着它的工作而更新。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在聊天中讓智能體記住或跟蹤某些內容 — 它會建立自己的表，此概覽會隨着它的工作而更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the agent in chat to remember something — it will call `db_create_table` to build the schema it needs. You can browse what it creates here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bitte den Agenten im Chat, sich etwas zu merken – er ruft `db_create_table` auf, um das benötigte Schema zu erstellen. Hier kannst du durchsehen, was er anlegt."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在聊天中请求智能体记住某些内容——它会调用 `db_create_table` 来构建所需的架构。你可以在此查看它创建的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask the agent in chat to remember something — it will create the tables it needs, and you can browse them here. You can also import a CSV or JSON file to start a table yourself." : {
      "comment" : "Subtitle for the \"no tables\" empty state in the Database workspace.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
